# Desktop Boilerplate — Cursor AI Rules

## Project Context

.NET 10 WPF enterprise desktop application boilerplate using Prism, Unity, HandyControl, SqlSugar, Serilog, Fody, and xUnit.

## Architecture

### Layer Ownership

- `src/Vk.Dbp.WpfWindow`: Shell startup (`PrismBootstrapper`), layout, themes, notifications, lock screen, navigation, host services
- `src/Vk.Dbp.AdminWindow`: Independent admin window
- `src/Vk.Dbp.Contracts`: Interfaces, Prism events, extension points, navigation contracts, shared service contracts
- `src/Vk.Dbp.Domain`: Domain abstractions
- `src/Vk.Dbp.Services`: Reusable services — session (`IUserSession`/`IUserInfo`), settings, audit, alarm, export, caching
- `src/Vk.Dbp.Infrastructure`: Entities, SqlSugar (`SqlSugarScope`), repositories, DB init (`IAppStartupService`)
- `src/Vk.Dbp.Utils`: Password hashing, SM4 encryption, ID generation, logging
- `src/Vk.Dbp.Tools`: Standalone tool applications
- `dbpframework/Vk.Dbp.Core`: Framework abstractions (`IDbpModule`)
- `dbpframework/Vk.Dbp.Account`: Account primitives (`CurrentUser`, `PermissionDto`)
- `prismModules/*`: Feature modules (`Dbp{Name}Module : IModule`)
- `dbpApps/*`: Customer application entry points

### Dependency Rules

- Dependencies flow inward: Presentation → Application → Domain → Infrastructure
- `dbpframework` is innermost; must NOT depend on `src/` or `prismModules/`
- Business modules must NOT depend on each other; use `Vk.Dbp.Contracts`
- ViewModels must NOT access SqlSugar/repositories directly; use service boundaries

## Code Conventions

- Constructor null-guards: `_svc = svc ?? throw new ArgumentNullException(nameof(svc))`
- ViewModels: `BindableBase`, `SetProperty(ref _field, value)`, `DelegateCommand` with `.ObservesProperty()`
- Event-subscribing ViewModels: implement `IDisposable` with `_isDisposed` guard
- UI updates in event callbacks: `Application.Current.Dispatcher.Invoke()`
- Navigation: use `INavigationService.NavigateTo()` from Contracts, NOT `IRegionManager.RequestNavigate`
- Cross-module communication: `IEventAggregator` (`PubSubEvent<T>`), not direct references
- View registration: `RegisterForNavigation<TView>()` with ViewModelLocator convention
- Service registration: `RegisterSingleton<IService, Impl>()` for shared stateful services
- Module naming: `Dbp{Name}Module : IModule`
- Navigation constants: `NavigationConstants.ViewNames`, `RegionNames`, `AccountActions`

## New Module Shape

```text
prismModules/Vk.Dbp.YourModule/
  Vk.Dbp.YourModule.csproj
  DbpYourModule.cs
  Views/  ViewModels/  Services/  Models/  Converters/  Constants/
```

Register in `PrismBootstrapper.ConfigureModuleCatalog` via `moduleCatalog.AddModule<DbpYourModule>()`.

## Security

- Never commit real credentials, tokens, or production passwords
- Use `appsettings.local.json` for developer-specific values
- `IUserInfo` for audit-only; `IUserSession` for full session management
- Use `IAuditLogService` for both successful and failed operations
- Session tokens: `RandomNumberGenerator`, in-memory only, cleared on `Logout()`
- SqlSugar connection errors trigger auto lock-screen
- Default test user (admin / 123456) is development-only

## Database Startup

```
Splash screen → IAppStartupService.InitializeDatabaseAsync() → Shell display → Initial navigation
```

DB init MUST complete before any DB-backed UI is accessed.

## Commands

```powershell
dotnet restore desktop.boilerplate.slnx
dotnet build desktop.boilerplate.slnx
dotnet test test\Vk.Dbp.Tests.Unit\Vk.Dbp.Tests.Unit.csproj
.\scripts\start-wpf-local.ps1
.\scripts\start-wpf-local.ps1 -FirstRun -AdminPassword "change-me"
```

## Testing

- xUnit + Moq + FluentAssertions
- Shared fixtures: `test/Vk.Dbp.Tests.Common`
- Integration tests: `test/Vk.Dbp.Tests.Integration` (requires SQL Server)

## Key Files

| Purpose | File |
|---------|------|
| Bootstrapper | `src/Vk.Dbp.WpfWindow/PrismBootstrapper.cs` |
| Navigation constants | `src/Vk.Dbp.WpfWindow/Constants/NavigationConstants.cs` |
| Navigation service | `src/Vk.Dbp.Contracts/Services/INavigationService.cs` |
| Session | `src/Vk.Dbp.Services/Session/UserSession.cs` |
| Theme service | `src/Vk.Dbp.WpfWindow/Services/ThemeService.cs` |
| Module example | `prismModules/Vk.Dbp.AccountModule/DbpAccountModule.cs` |
